---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party content
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Rust dependencies are listed in Cargo.lock. Four crates come from Epoch itself
- epoch-kernel, epoch-models, epoch-assets and epoch-secrets - and are the same
code under the same licence.

EpochServices bundles no models and no runtimes. It finds what is already on the
machine and offers to fetch the rest from its own publisher, exactly as Epoch
does.
